{"text": " Every sound becomes a body, every echo learns to breathe, what the noise creates the silence takes, so keep this world with me. I woke where nothing had a name No ground, no sky Only an empty world Waiting to hear itself Every sound becomes a party Every echo learns to breathe What the noise creates, the silence takes So keep this world with me First, I heard voices beneath the dark Not words One note Held longer than breath Their breath grew edges, their throats opened Opened into brass. Then I heard footsteps crossing a place that had no floor. The darkness placed stone beneath them, the steps repeated, and repetition became law. I heard a heartbeat behind the horizon, then another, then thousands, all beating inside the same chests then the rain began to rise out of the ocean through the clouds And into the stars Every drop struck the sky And left a note hanging there And the melody turned gold I said move And gravity found a beat I said live And every sound Came home Anytime Comes a body Every echo learns to breathe What the noise creates The silence takes So keep this world with me Voices into brass Steps into drums Blood into bass Rain into light Every echo Alive Then I stopped speaking The stars went out The ground forgot my feet The ocean fell out of the sky Even my heartbeat Began to fade That was when I learned The final rule What sound creates Silence takes So I keep telling this story I keep the rhythm moving I keep this world alive And every time I reach the end I begin again First I heard, heard Voices beneath the dark Nope Wait, DX", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 5.02, "end": 22.64, "text": " Every sound becomes a body, every echo learns to breathe, what the noise creates the silence takes, so keep this world with me.", "tokens": [50365, 2048, 1626, 3643, 257, 1772, 11, 633, 14300, 27152, 281, 10192, 11, 437, 264, 5658, 7829, 264, 12239, 2516, 11, 370, 1066, 341, 1002, 365, 385, 13, 51670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0